Z||000000||FieroMaster88||06-11-2001||04:33 AM||||  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/James_Boom_Boom.JPG">  <BR>Well, there it is. My subwoofer.  It is a JL Audio 12W4.  I have a Rockford Fosgate 250a2 amp running it (only pushes about 100 watts to it RMS) and i have a Eclipse (forgot the model number) head unit w/remote.  What are good component sets?  Was thinking of doing a 4" component set in the dash...and was lookin at the JL audio components....but i am not srue.<P>As for other mods i have pictures of:<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/J_Gauges.JPG"> <BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/J_Corner_Close.JPG">  <BR>There are my pillar gauges (soon to be 3 gauge pod for boost gauge) and my side scoop.   I have other mods, like AcCell 8.8mm wires, AcCell Coils, RapidFire #1 plugs, K&N Filter, Fierostore Automatic trans shift kit...  Soon to have lowering springs and new rims.<P>------------------<BR>         <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/FieroMaster88.gif">         <BR>James Essar<BR>AOL IM Name: FieroMaster88<BR>88 Coupe 30,000 miles   <IMG SRC="http://cwm.ragesofsanity.com/s/net4/smiling2.gif">  <p>[This message has been edited by FieroMaster88 (edited 06-11-2001).]||||reg||12
