Z||000004||FieroMaster88||06-11-2001||01:54 PM||||Nope...that is how big it always was....just looks bigger because the picture was taken at an angle.<BR>Yes, the visibility has been cut a little with my banner...but only when trying to see the stop lights.  So now after installing it i have to stop about as far away from the light as really old people do...and bend down some.  So i bet I look pretty stupid.  OOh well.<BR>As far as me dating legless girls.....NO.  I have not been on a date in 2 years....broke up with a girl i dated for about 2 years and have not met anyone else.  But my friends who decide to ride with me say they have plenty of leg room.  But i figure if I find a girl and she loves me, she will understand (or walk??)<P>Later<P>------------------<BR>         <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/FieroMaster88.gif">         <BR>James Essar<BR>AOL IM Name: FieroMaster88<BR>88 Coupe 30,000 miles   <IMG SRC="http://cwm.ragesofsanity.com/s/net4/smiling2.gif">  <p>[This message has been edited by FieroMaster88 (edited 06-11-2001).]||||reg||6
